      <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.guidance"><source>Copies the existing caption lines to the files they currently match and attaches them to those images. The original Quick captions text is retained. After conversion, Image metadata is authoritative and captions remain stable when files are reordered, added, or removed.</source></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.randomBlocked"><source>Legacy captions cannot be converted while Random order is selected. Choose Filename or Modification time, save the gallery, then convert.</source></trans-unit>
